 Get an item.
 
+#### .getOrInsertComputed(key, factory)
+
+Get an item, or synchronously compute and insert it when the item is missing or expired. The `factory` receives the key and is called once only when needed. Existing items are marked as recently used like `.get()`. The inserted item uses the cache's default `maxAge`. If the `factory` throws, the error is propagated and no value is inserted.
+
 #### .has(key)
 
 Check if an item exists.
